### Phase 1: Data Sources (Scanners)

#### [NEW] `data/local/cleanfile/BigFileScanner.kt`
- Quét toàn bộ storage, lọc file > 500MB
- Trả về `List<CleanFileItem>` sort theo size giảm dần
- Hỗ trợ filter theo type: All / Photo / Video / Music / Other

#### [NEW] `data/local/cleanfile/MediaCleanupScanner.kt`
- Dùng `MediaStore` để quét Video / Photo / Audio
- Nhóm kết quả theo folder → trả về `List<CleanFileGroup>`
